title: Black Militia
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: reichsbanner_timer <= 0
card-image: img/kcp_rb.png
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; reichsbanner_timer += 6; rb_militarization_cost = 2 if rb_militancy > 0.1 else rb_militarization_cost = 1; rb_militarization_cost = 3 if rb_militancy > 0.25
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Paramilitary organizing in defense of the republic.

= Reichsbanner

The Black Militia is a paramilitary organization with history within Guran seperatism but with our historical alignment to Gura it has been often associated with us and through Pengu we can build it up to be a stronger defense force of the republic.

[? if workers_kcp < 46 or workers_kcp < workers_hp or workers_kcp < workers_vnpf : The Black Militia is having a more difficult time recruiting, as the KCP is no longer the dominant party within Gura. ?]

- @militant: Fund more military-style training and equipment for the Black Militia.
- @militant_2: Use our existing resources to support more training for the Black Militia.
- @same: Keep the Black Militia as it is.
- @cut_rb: Cut funding for the  Black Militia.
- @women_rb
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

#- Orient reichsbanner towards anti-fascism (only available if we have prioritized anti fascism)

@militant
choose-if: resources >= rb_militarization_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ rb_militarization_cost +] needed).
subtitle: -[+ rb_militarization_cost +] resources
on-arrival: resources -= rb_militarization_cost; rb_investment += 1; rb_strength += 100; rb_militancy += 0.05; neoforsvollrist_strength += 2; neoforsvollrist_dissent -= 2; humanist_dissent += 5; kcp_militancy += 0.05; workers_kcp += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 2*(1-dissent); up_relation -= 5

Some of our fellow party members decry increasing funding to a previously seperatist militia. The Neoforsvollrist gain ground in the party.

@militant_2
view-if: funded_reichsbanner >= 1
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 0.02; funded_reichsbanner -= 1

As we have already funded resources towards the Black Militia, we can invest in building up their militancy.


@same

The Black Militia is already serving the purpose it needs to serve. There is no reason to change what already works.

- @return: Continue...


@cut_rb
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: resources += 1; rb_strength -= 100; rb_militancy -= 0.05; neoforsvollrist_strength -= 2; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 2; kcp_militancy -= 0.05; workers_hp += 2; unemployed_hp += 2

Cutting resources to the Black Militia causes a drop in the membership but also weakens the Neoforsvollrists and radicals among us.

@women_rb
title: Allow women to join the Reichsbanner.
subtitle: -1 resources - This might cause a backlash from existing members.
choose-if: resources > 0
view-if: womens_rights >= 4
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rb_militancy *= 0.85; rb_strength += 400; women_in_rb = 1; rb_militancy += 0.05 if repealed_175; rb_militancy += 0.04 if trans_rights; rb_militancy += 0.02 if reformed_183;

Women have previously not been allowed to join the Black Militia but with our progressive action in goverment finaly they may. [? if homosexual_rights > 0: And with our propagation of gender and sexual minorities we are even able to form small squadrons of trans and other queer people. ?].


